<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (The 2026 Rosehill College Ball was held on the 4th of July, and it was truly an amazing night. As we walked into the venue, we were greeted by a magical flower archway provided to us by the wonderful Wild Apricot Events. Our vision was absolutely brought to life by their team. Apart from the main decorations, the stunning table centre pieces placed on each and every table were crafted by the events committee themselves. The decorations were beautiful, however the main event of the ball was the students, who looked absolutely striking all dressed up. But who did the students think impressed? The award for the best dressed boy went to Iori Lemuelu-Villiamu who absolutely blinded us with his amazing yellow suit. The award for best dressed girl went to Kelsey Beetham, who gave us pure vibrant energy with her beautiful pink dress.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
