123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Awards were also given for Beau and Belle \(Year 12 Rosehill students attending ball together\) as well as King and Queen \(Year 13 Rosehill students attending ball together\), these awards by far are the most anticipated of the night. The award for Beau and Belle went to Abby Jellie and Wilz Rupapera, and the award for King and Queen went to Leelee Green-McNiff and Henry Mayall who looked absolutely stunning as they accepted their matching satin sashes. Once the awards were handed out, the energy stayed high as students took over the dance floor. There was a lot of effort put into the behind the scenes of the ball, and the events committee would like to thank our providers and everyone who dedicated their time to help us create this memorable event.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
