/E (On the 31st of July, the long-awaited Talent Show finally took place. After months of planning, including finding capable judges and searching for the best singers, dancers, and supergroups within Rosehill, it was amazing to finally see it all come together. It was an amazing, high-energy night, and it was so much fun to see it go down so well. Every single performer gave it their all and showed their mana, each in their own unique way. )
