/E (On Thursday 20th August, the Level 3 Biology students completed their annual trip to Auckland Zoo. The trip provided a valuable opportunity for students to consolidate and apply their learning for the Human Evolution paper, which they will sit in their external exams at the end of the year. As part of the visit, students took part in a hands-on workshop where they examined a range of skeletons, skulls and tools. This allowed them to make connections between the concepts they have studied in class and real examples of human evolution and biological change.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
