/E (On Saturday 18th July five Rosehill College students competed in the Drury Strength and Fitness HYROX. Shyla, Dayton, Cody, Justin and Mitchell absolutely smashed the Mini Rox category. This consisted of seven 450 metre runs in between 40 burpees, 40 sand bag lunges and 50 wall balls as some of the exercises. Their hard work, dedication to weekly training and motivation all paid off when they completed this intense workout!)
