/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (We wanted to share a special occasion for Ethan that occurred over the holidays. On Saturday 11th July Ethan represented NZ in the NZ U16 American Football team against Australia. The day saw the NZ U16, NZ U18 and NZ Mens sides take on their Australian counterparts at the Trusts Arena Stadium in Henderson.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Ethan trialled for the team back in January, was selected for the wider squad in February, and made the final team in June. At the jersey presentation on the Thursday before the game Ethan was announced as one of the co-captains for the team which was an incredible honor, but also a great reward for all the hard work he had put in over the last 4 months.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
186 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Unfortunately Australia were too strong on the day and the NZ team were soundly beaten 44 - 0. However it was a great occasion and all the boys represented themselves and their communities with pride and passion.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (ETHAN FLETCHER U16 NZ AMERICAN FOOTBALL REP)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Ethan doesn't need or want any fanfare made of the achievement, but we thought it important to share with you what has been an incredible experience for him. We also wanted to share our thanks as his growth in the team was heavily supported by the opportunities he has had at school in his leadership role \(such as the Blues leadership days\), the experiences from his 12PEO class, and the physical development on the rugby field from Saua and the 1st XV coaching team.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
