/E (Sophie Clark and I took a group of sixteen Year 9 and 10 students out for an event called 'Get 2 Go'. This event consisted of 3 different team challenges. We started our day at Onehunga basin reserve for a kayak and stand up paddle board challenge. We then head to Western Springs for orienteering and finished at Grey Lynn for mountain biking.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (These students represented our kura with pride and demonstrated the Rosehill values not only within their team but also with the event organisers and other schools. We had a lot of exhausted and muddy kids by the end of the day but overall, they had a blast.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
