232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (FiaFia Night was a wonderful cultural event that was held at our school, bringing together students, families, and staff to celebrate the diverse cultures within our community. In the weeks leading up to the event, students worked incredibly hard preparing their performances, practising traditional dances, learning routines, and organising cultural displays. On the night, everyone was filled with much anticipated excitement as students took to the stage to showcase their cultural identities through music, dance, costumes, and performances. It was especially rewarding to see the confidence and enthusiasm students displayed while sharing traditions that were meaningful to them. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
