243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (On Wednesday the 12th of August Academic kicked off with the STEM-EX competition taking place. This was a MATHEX style competition with a sciencey twist with the prize of house points for the winning house. The juniors and seniors battled for house points with Manutaki taking first place overall. On Thursday, there was a fun trivia quiz with general knowledge questions to get students around the school thinking with the prize of lollies for the winning group. Lastly, throughout the week, there was a writing competition available for students to submit their own piece of writing with the chance of winning a $30 dollar Prezzy Card. The chosen winner of this writing competition was Srirama Nimmakayala.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (All of the academic leaders are grateful for those who came, participated, and showed house spirit. Thank you for making 2026 Academic Week successful!)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
