endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (This term the Arts Committee held Arts Week during Week 2. This was an eventful week aiming to express the talents within our school alongside competitive house spirit. Monday held the House Quiz of all things Music, Movies and Facts. Manutaki easily took the win with Pounamu in second. Tuesday brung a new event for our school, Cupcake decorating competition. The turn out was amazing! The creativity and use of baking and decorating ingredients lead to a tight competition with amazing designs. Congratulations to Olivia McDonald with her Mike Wazowski design.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (Wednesday was our annual chalk art competition. The creative use of space and layering of chalk had a great turn out. It was difficult for the judges but Rangatahi got first with Pounamu close in second once again. Then on to Thursday with origami. This proved a challenge for some, while others were a natural. We would like to thank everyone for their contribution and hard work during Arts Week and congratulations for the amazing work everyone produced.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
